<title>POLAND: POLL-POLISH 3-MONTH WIBOR SEEN AT 23.90 AT END-97.</title>
<headline>POLL-POLISH 3-MONTH WIBOR SEEN AT 23.90 AT END-97.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Warsaw Interbank Offered Rate (WIBOR) for three-month deposits is expected to ease to 23.90 percent by year end from 25.24 percent on Monday, a Reuter poll of Poland's 27 biggest banks showed.</p>
<p>		AUGUST	 END-97	  12-MONTHS AHEAD</p>
<p> WIBOR AVG  24.95	23.90 (20.96)	21.33 (19.23)</p>
<p>    MINIMUM 23.20	21.20 (16.00)	18.00 (14.50)</p>
<p>    MAXIMUM 26.20	26.50 (23.20)	23.50 (22.50)</p>
<p>NOTE: In brackets previous figures for end-97 and July-98 from last month's poll.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
